>,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">]</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">js</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"思路\">思路</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>设<code>n = mat.length</code>，<code>m = mat[0].length</code></li>\n<li>用<code>d</code>记录当前方向，<code>d = 1</code>代表当前方向为左下 => 右上</li>\n<li>用<code>d</code>记录当前方向，<code>d = 0</code>代表当前方向为右上 => 左下</li>\n<li>左下至右上每移动一次，<code>i - 1</code>, <code>j + 1</code></li>\n<li>右上至左下每移动一次，<code>i + 1</code>, <code>j - 1</code></li>\n<li>当左下 => 右上遇到边界情况如下：\n<ul>\n<li><code>i = 0</code>时，此时抵达上边界，且<code>j + 1 &#x3C; m</code>时（确保横向移动不会超出范围），横向移动一格，并调转方向（更改d的值）</li>\n<li><code>j = m - 1</code> 时，此时抵达右边界，且<code>i + 1 &#x3C; n</code>时（确保纵向移动不会超出范围），纵向移动一格，并调转方向</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>右上 => 左下的分析与上面一致，只是边界变成了左边界与下边界</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码\">代码</h3>\n<h3 id=\"solution-javascript\">solution-javascript</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">@</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">param</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#2E8F82;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">number[][]</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\">}</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#78CCF0;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> mat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">@</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">return</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#2E8F82;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">number[]</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">const</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82